nodes.body:
Could a maintainer add `ready`? `pre-run-check` gates CI on that label for authors with no merged PRs, so nothing has run on this yet.

It's frontend-only - one parser file plus its tests. The xlam streaming parser never updates `streamed_args_for_tool`, so `finalize_generation` treats the arguments as unstreamed and appends them a second time at end of stream; clients reconstruct invalid JSON like `{"city": "X"}{"city": "X"}`. Dupe-check and local test results are in the description.

@chaunceyjiang @aarnphm

